Probably from {{der|en|non|kúga||to oppress}} (whence also {{cog|no|-}} and {{cog|da|kue}}, {{cog|sv|kuva}}); compare {{cog|is|kúfa||to set on top}} and {{cog|fo|kúga||to oppress}}.

