#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:intimidate}}
#: {{ux|en|Con artists are not '''cowed''' by the law.}}
#* {{RQ:Spectator|II|167|September 11 1711|Steele|passage=To vanquish a people already '''cowed'''.}}
